b:["$","p",null,{"children":"All cryptocurrency transactions on OmniPay.cc are processed by Stripe, Inc. through its Crypto Onramp service. When you make a purchase, your information is shared directly with Stripe, which processes and secures your payment according to its own Privacy Policy and Crypto Onramp Terms."}]
